    "## 1.3 Research Question & Objectives\n",
    "\n",
    "Derived from the problem statement the following research question was formulated:\n",
    "_How did the snowstorm event from the 2nd of January to the 11th of January affect the duration of train delays, the number of cancellations, and punctuality at Utrecht Centraal, compared with a typical period under normal weather conditions?_\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on the above research question the following six objectives have been set:\n",
    "1. Establish a baseline for the weather conditions at Utrecht Centraal from the 2nd \n",
    "    of January to the 11th of January, in terms of temperature, precipitation, dew point, windspeed and snow occurrence.\n",
    "2. Establish a baseline of NS operations and performance at Utrecht Centraal from the \n",
    "    2nd of January to the 11th of January, in terms of delay duration, number of cancellations, and punctuality.\n",
    "3. Visualize and describe the weather patterns at Utrecht Centraal during the \n",
    "    snowstorm event, using temperature, precipitation, dew point, windspeed and snow occurrence.\n",
    "4. Visualize and describe NS operations and performance at Utrecht Centraal during \n",
    "    the snowstorm event, using delay duration, number of cancellations, and punctuality.\n",
    "5. Compare the baseline of NS with the performance of NS at Utrecht Centraal during \n",
    "    the snowstorm event in order to determine the impact of the snowstorm event on delay duration, number of cancellations, and punctuality.\n",
    "6. Compare the weather scenarios with the NS train scenarios in order to determine \n",
    "    the relationship between the weather indicators and the performance indicators.\n"
   ]
  },
