    "## 2.3 Data Pipeline"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The data analysis was split into two teams: Team Weather and Team Train. These two teams worked in parallel for steps 1 to 8, coming together to do step 9. \n",
    "\n",
    "The complete data pipeline consisted of the following general steps:\n",
    "1. Import the datasets\n",
    "2. Clean, filter, and process the data based on assumptions and the research scope\n",
    "4. Calculate the relevant indicators\n",
    "5. Establish the two baselines\n",
    "6. Identify and analyse performance during the snowstorm period.\n",
    "7. Compare snowstorm performance with the baselines.\n",
    "8. Generate visualizations and findings with respect to the relevant indicators\n",
    "9. Combine visualizations and findings across teams to gain insight into the relationship\n",
    "   between indicators.\n",
    "\n",
    "The following steps were specifically taken by Team Weather:\n",
    "1. Import the weather dataset from KNMI\n",
    "2. Process dates and hours and convert KNMI scaled values to standard units\n",
    "3. Clean and filter the data based on on assumptions,\n",
    "   and the Utrecht Centraal study period.\n",
    "4. Calculate weather indicators, including temperature,\n",
    "   dew point, percipitation, windspeed, and snow occurence.\n",
    "5. Establish baseline performance of typical weather patterns.\n",
    "6. Identify and analyse weather patterns during the snowstorm period.\n",
    "7. Compare snowstorm performance with the baseline.\n",
    "8. Generate visualizations and findings for the operational impact of\n",
    "   the snowstorm.\n",
    "\n",
    "The following steps were specifically taken by Team Train:\n",
    "1. Import the train dataset from Rijden de Treinen\n",
    "2. Clean and filter the data based on assumptions, relevant services,\n",
    "   and the Utrecht Centraal study period.\n",
    "3. Process arrival and departure delays and identify cancelled services.\n",
    "4. Calculate operational performance indicators, including delay duration,\n",
    "   cancellations, and punctuality.\n",
    "5. Establish baseline performance under typical weather conditions.\n",
    "6. Identify and analyse operations during the snowstorm period.\n",
    "7. Compare snowstorm performance with the baseline.\n",
    "8. Generate visualizations and findings for characteristics of\n",
    "   the snowstorm."
   ]
  },
